Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.50,H_ms,,0,0,0,,"Kau takut dia kembali HIDUP?"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:34.50,C_ms,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episod PERCUMA ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:01.22,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Shen Zhenzhu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.17,0:00:03.61,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Sejak perkara menimpa Shen Nian,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:05.33,S_ms,,0,0,0,,awak terus berusaha
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.93,S_ms,,0,0,0,,untuk menghalangi semua orang mencarinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:08.50,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:09.94,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Saya tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:14.08,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Awak takut apa sebenarnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:16.08,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Awak takut dia kembali hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:21.12,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Saya hanya menerima kenyataan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:22.76,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kakaknya sudah mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.36,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Dia sudah lama ditelan jerung.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:27.57,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Ya ke?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:30.36,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, berdoalah awak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:32.27,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Agar dia betul-betul mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.31,0:00:34.50,S_ms,,0,0,0,,Kerana dia mungkin masih hidup.
